        "usage": {
          "completeness": "complete",
          "quantities": {
            "input": 1000,
            "output": 1000
          }
        }
      },
      "derivation": [
        "vector-mini is a model id, and also a retired alias of vector-text: the exact id wins (ID-4).",
        "Rates (vector-mini): input 0.5, output 2 per 10^6 tokens.",
        "input: 1000 * 0.5 / 10^6 = 0.0005; output: 1000 * 2 / 10^6 = 0.002",
        "exact = 0.0025 = 1/400",
        "estimate = floor((200 + 400) / 800) = 0 -> 0.00; booked = 0.01",
        "Resolving to vector-text instead would refuse: its required components are absent."
      ],
      "expected": {
        "provider": "anthropic",
        "modelId": "vector-mini",
        "tier": "anthropic:standard",
